    "description": "Price Reduced. Impressive mid-century Outer Sunset apartment building. This well-maintained 5-unit building has 4 mid-size one-bedroom apartments and 1 very large three-bedroom, 2-bath unit with nearly 1,200 square feet. The building will be delivered with 3 vacant one-bedroom units-2 units are currently vacant and an additional unit is scheduled to be vacant on June 1, 2025. There is one-for-one parking and on-site laundry. The stucco facade has a minimalist design with modern charm, while the entry and hallways have terrazzo flooring that retains an elegant and clean flavor. Outer Judah's commercial district is nearby as well as the N-Judah light rail line."
